# ============================================================
# Large experiment artifacts
# ============================================================

# Per-sample prediction dumps can become large.
results/**/predictions.csv

# Resolved local environments are not important for Git.
results/**/requirements-resolved.txt

# Error logs from interrupted runs.
results/**/error.log

# ============================================================
# Keep research results
# ============================================================
#
# IMPORTANT:
# We intentionally DO NOT ignore results/ entirely.
#
# Small reproducibility artifacts should remain versioned:
#
#   metrics.json
#   suite.json
#   config.json
#   environment.json
#   source_hashes.json
#   RESULTS.md
#   *.png
#
# This makes the GitHub repository useful as a research record
# without committing datasets or neural-network checkpoints.